Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.46,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这条命令来自这节课的 README\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A command from this lecture's README,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.46,0:00:05.11,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在一台从没构建过这个 image 的笔记本上运行\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}on a laptop that never built this image:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.11,0:00:08.43,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,本地没有 image，它就从 Docker Hub pull 一个下来\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}with no local image, it pulls one from Docker Hub.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.75,0:00:15.00,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在里面，Python 显示的是 3.8.17，而 Gemini 的库导入不了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Inside, Python says 3.8.17, and the Gemini library won't import.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.23,0:00:19.03,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,可这个 repo 的 Dockerfile 写的是 Python 3.14\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Yet this repo's Dockerfile says Python 3.14.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.35,0:00:24.68,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个 image 是 2025 年 2 月构建的，用的是 Python 3.8\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}This image was built in February 2025, with Python 3.8.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.00,0:00:26.42,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它是从哪儿来的？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Where did it come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.47,0:00:32.40,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第二个意外来自另一个教程：一个在 port 9200 上监听的服务器\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A second surprise, from the other tutorial: a server listening on port 9200.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.72,0:00:34.67,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,笔记本连不上它\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The laptop can't reach it;
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.67,0:00:38.58,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,另一个 container 按名字去问，却得到了回复：ok\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}another container, asking by name, gets a reply: ok.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.83,0:00:40.13,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,两个谜题\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Two puzzles.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.18,0:00:44.14,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第一部分：那个 image 是从哪儿来的，你该自己构建还是 pull？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Part 1: where did that image come from, and should you build or pull?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.46,0:00:46.62,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第二部分：这是谁的 localhost？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Part 2: whose localhost is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.87,0:00:51.39,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,进度条显示 README 的步骤，代码面板标出文件和行号\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The tracker shows the README step, code panels show file and line numbers.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.71,0:00:53.97,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,看到黄色的 your turn 标签就暂停\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause at the yellow your-turn tag;
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.97,0:00:57.56,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,灰色的 extra 标签表示 README 里没有的命令\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}gray extra tags mark commands the README doesn't have.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.80,0:01:00.34,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,每条命令也都在学习指南里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Every command is also in the study guide.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.66,0:01:02.56,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第一部分需要 Tutorial 0\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Part 1 needs Tutorial 0 and a Google Cloud project with billing; part 2 needs only Docker.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.56,0:01:05.57,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,以及一个开通了结算的 Google Cloud 项目\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Part 1 needs Tutorial 0 and a Google Cloud project with billing; part 2 needs only Docker.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.57,0:01:07.29,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第二部分只需要 Docker\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Part 1 needs Tutorial 0 and a Google Cloud project with billing; part 2 needs only Docker.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.53,0:01:09.34,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,我们是在 Linux 上录制的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}We recorded on Linux,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.34,0:01:13.72,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,录制时用的是 Docker Engine 29.8.2\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}with Docker Engine 29.8.2 at the time of recording.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.04,0:01:18.01,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在 Mac 或 Git BASH 里，提示符和少数几条消息会不一样\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}On a Mac or in Git BASH, the prompt and a few messages differ;
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.01,0:01:19.86,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,命令和 port 不会变\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the commands and ports don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.10,0:01:23.02,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,有一点先说清楚：我们录制时没有 Google 账号\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}One honest limit: we had no Google account.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.34,0:01:25.18,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,凡是代码调用 Google 的地方\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Wherever the code calls Google,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.18,0:01:29.98,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,你会看到命令、缺少密钥时的真实报错，以及该看什么\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}you'll see the command, the real error a missing key gives, and what to look for.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.02,0:01:35.49,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在第 3 讲里，课程给了你一个共用的 bucket 和一个共用的密钥\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}In lecture 3, the course handed you a shared bucket and one shared key,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.49,0:01:37.69,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,复制进了每个组件目录\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}copied into every component folder.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.01,0:01:42.49,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个分支还是同一条 pipeline，只是照真正团队的做法来搭建\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}This branch is the same pipeline, built the way a real team would build it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.73,0:01:44.44,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,你们组有自己的 bucket\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Your team owns its bucket.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.76,0:01:49.15,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,你要创建自己的服务账号，把它唯一的密钥放在 repo 外面\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}You create your own service account, and keep its one key outside the repo.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.40,0:01:51.99,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,你不用再写 Dockerfile 了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}You no longer write the Dockerfile:
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.99,0:01:56.20,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它已经和 pyproject.toml、uv.lock 一起 commit 了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}it's committed, together with pyproject.toml and uv.lock.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.52,0:02:00.11,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,而且每个组件都有一个脚本，docker-shell.sh\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}And each component has one script, docker-shell.sh,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.11,0:02:04.12,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,里面装着那两条很长的 docker build 和 docker run 命令\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}that holds the long docker build and docker run commands.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.37,0:02:08.53,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,五个阶段没有变，它们仍然从不互相调用\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The five stages haven't changed, and they still never call each other:
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.53,0:02:11.75,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,每个都写进 bucket，下一个再从里面读\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}each writes to the bucket, and the next reads from it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.07,0:02:14.97,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,直接通信的 container，第二部分再讲\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Containers that talk directly come in part 2.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.22,0:02:17.35,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一个团队有两个办法拿到 image\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A team can get an image two ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.67,0:02:21.64,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,项目早期，每个人都用 Git 里的配方自己构建\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Early in a project, everyone builds it from the recipe in Git.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.96,0:02:25.78,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,后来，一个人把做好的 image 发布到 Docker Hub\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Later, one person publishes finished images to Docker Hub,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.78,0:02:27.38,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,其他人都直接 pull\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and everyone else pulls.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.60,0:02:29.20,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,仔细看这个 tag\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Look closely at the tag.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.35,0:02:33.10,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它是一个路标，指向某一个特定的 image\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}It's a signpost to one particular image, built on some day,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.10,0:02:35.13,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,某一天、用某个版本的配方构建出来的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}from some version of the recipe.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.45,0:02:38.22,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,没有任何东西保证它和你手上的 commit 对得上\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Nothing promises it matches the commit you have.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.47,0:02:42.65,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,有一个脚本决定你拿到的是哪一个；我们会一行一行地读它\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}One script decides which of the two you get; we'll read it line by line.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.97,0:02:44.32,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,先拿到代码\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}First, the code.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.37,0:02:45.79,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,从头开始？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Starting fresh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.84,0:02:47.65,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在你的工作区目录里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}From your workspace folder,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.65,0:02:50.59,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,clone 这个 repo 并直接 checkout 到这个分支\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}clone the repo with this branch checked out:
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.59,0:02:53.13,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,git clone，加上 --branch flexible-workflow\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}git clone, --branch flexible-workflow.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.45,0:02:55.55,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后 cd 进 mega-pipeline\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Then cd into mega-pipeline.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.87,0:02:57.35,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，两条都跑一遍\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause and run both.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.40,0:02:59.51,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,两个额外检查：git branch 显示\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Two extra checks: git branch
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.51,0:03:03.28,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,当前分支是 flexible-workflow，停在我们录制时的那个 commit\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}shows flexible-workflow at the commit we recorded,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.28,0:03:04.79,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,transcribe audio 里有\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and transcribe audio
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.79,0:03:09.39,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Dockerfile、这个脚本、pyproject.toml 和 uv.lock\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}holds its Dockerfile, the script, pyproject.toml and uv.lock,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.39,0:03:11.35,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,都由这个分支 commit 好了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}which this branch commits.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.60,0:03:13.82,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,已经有第 3 讲的 clone 了？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Already have your clone from lecture 3?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.14,0:03:17.64,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它在 main 上；如果你是重新 clone 的，直接跳到下一章\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}It's on main; if you cloned fresh, skip to the next chapter.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.96,0:03:19.86,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 1 步：cd 进去\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 1: cd into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.18,0:03:22.16,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,两个额外检查显示它现在的状态\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Two extra checks show its state.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.87,0:03:24.22,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,分成三堆\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Three piles.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.27,0:03:26.73,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,你改过的 cli.py 是已跟踪的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Your edited cli.py is tracked.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.05,0:03:30.14,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,你在 generate text 里新建的两个文件是未跟踪的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Your two new files in generate text are untracked.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.46,0:03:32.11,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在 transcribe audio 里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}In transcribe audio,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.11,0:03:37.39,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Dockerfile、pyproject.toml、uv.lock 和密钥都是被忽略的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the Dockerfile, pyproject.toml, uv.lock and the key are ignored.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.63,0:03:39.66,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 2 步：git fetch origin\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 2, git fetch origin.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.98,0:03:41.42,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在这里它什么都没打印\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Here it prints nothing:
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.42,0:03:45.40,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,clone 下来的 repo 本来就有所有分支，上游也没有任何变化\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}a clone already has every branch, and nothing had changed upstream.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.72,0:03:47.32,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,你的可能会列出一些更新\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Yours may list updates.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.53,0:03:50.23,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 3 步：git checkout flexible-workflow\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 3, git checkout flexible-workflow,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.23,0:03:52.50,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Git 拒绝了，原因有两个\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and Git refuses, for two reasons.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.75,0:03:55.62,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,你对 cli.py 的修改会被覆盖\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Your edits to cli.py would be overwritten,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.62,0:04:00.13,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,而且两个未跟踪的文件正好放在这个分支自己也有文件的地方\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and two untracked files sit where the branch has files of its own.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.45,0:04:01.82,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,什么都没变\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Nothing changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.87,0:04:04.53,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,README 的提示解决的是第一个原因\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The README's note covers the first reason:
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.53,0:04:08.14,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,git stash 把你的修改收起来，第一堵墙倒了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}git stash puts your edits away, and the first wall falls.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.46,0:04:11.34,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,再试一次，未跟踪的文件还是挡着它\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}On a retry, the untracked files still block it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.58,0:04:14.78,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一个小缺口：这条提示只管改过的文件\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A small gap: the note covers only edited files.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.10,0:04:16.60,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,额外跑一个 git stash -u\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}An extra git stash -u
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.60,0:04:20.18,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,把未跟踪的文件也 stash 起来，checkout 就成功了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}stashes untracked files too, and the checkout works.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.50,0:04:23.16,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,另一个办法是 git checkout，加上 -- 和一个点\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The other option, git checkout -- .,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.16,0:04:27.07,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它丢弃你的修改，不动未跟踪的文件\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}discards your edits and leaves untracked files alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.32,0:04:30.75,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 5 步，git branch：星号在 flexible-workflow 上\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 5, git branch: * flexible-workflow.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.07,0:04:36.05,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,切换你自己的 clone 之前，先把第 3 讲里想保留的 Dockerfile\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Before you switch your own clone, copy out any lecture 3 Dockerfile,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.05,0:04:41.18,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,pyproject.toml 和 uv.lock 复制出来：切换会把它们替换掉\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}pyproject.toml and uv.lock you want to keep: the switch replaces them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.50,0:04:42.88,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，切换过去\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause and switch.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.93,0:04:46.79,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,额外检查显示，你在第 3 讲里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Extra checks show your ignored lecture 3 Dockerfile,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.79,0:04:50.13,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,那些被忽略的 Dockerfile、pyproject.toml 和 uv.lock\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}pyproject.toml and uv.lock were replaced by the branch's,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.13,0:04:52.13,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,已经被这个分支的版本一声不吭地替换了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}without a word:
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.13,0:04:54.88,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,想留着的话，先把它们复制出来\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}copy them out first if you want them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.12,0:04:58.41,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,旧密钥还留在 transcribe audio 里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The old key still sits inside transcribe audio;
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.41,0:05:01.35,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,你的 secrets 原地不动，README 也是这么说的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}your secrets stay put, as the README says.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.67,0:05:04.24,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在那个目录里，每次构建都会把它复制进 image\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Every build there copies it into the image,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.24,0:05:07.00,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,所以现在就把每个组件的 secrets 目录删掉\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}so delete each component's secrets folder now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.32,0:05:09.03,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,你的修改还在 stash 里等着\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Your edits wait in the stash.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.55,0:05:13.43,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,运行之前，先看 README 里的目录结构\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Before you run, the README's folder layout:
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.43,0:05:18.00,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,你的密钥放在 repo 旁边的 secrets 目录里，绝不放进 repo\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}your key lives in a secrets folder beside the repo, never inside it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.32,0:05:21.64,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,往上退一级，回到你的工作区目录，把这个目录建好\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Go up one level, to your workspace, and create that folder.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.08,0:05:28.12,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 2 步：每个 cli.py 都在开头附近设置三个值\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 2: every cli.py sets three values near the top:
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.12,0:05:32.00,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,你的项目 ID、你的 bucket 和你们的组名\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}your project ID, your bucket, and your group name.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.23,0:05:35.77,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一个额外的 grep 显示 repo 里原本写的是什么\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}An extra grep shows what ships: three files are blank,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.77,0:05:40.59,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,三个文件留空，但 generate text 和 translate text 里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}but generate text and translate text already hold the course's project and bucket,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.59,0:05:43.24,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,已经写着课程的项目和 bucket，还有授课老师的组名\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and the instructor's group name.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.48,0:05:47.65,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一个小疏漏：README 说如果你忘了改\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A small slip: the README says an assert stops you if you forget,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.65,0:05:49.93,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,assert 会拦住你，但它只拒绝空值\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}but it only rejects an empty value.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.25,0:05:54.25,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,那两个文件会把你的调用发到课程的项目和 bucket\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Those two files would send your calls to the course's project and bucket,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.25,0:05:56.39,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在那边报权限错误\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}where they fail with permission errors.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.63,0:05:58.92,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,三个值都要设置，五个文件都要改\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Set all three, in all five files.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.24,0:06:02.12,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,额外的 git diff 显示了我们的占位值\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}An extra git diff shows our placeholders,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.12,0:06:05.40,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,your-project-id、your-team-bucket 和 group-01\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}your-project-id, your-team-bucket and group-01;
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.40,0:06:06.67,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,换成你自己的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}type your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.72,0:06:11.57,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在 translate text 里，还要把目标语言从西班牙语改成法语\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}In translate text, also change the target language from Spanish to French.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.89,0:06:13.40,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，把它们改好\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause and edit them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.45,0:06:17.80,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 3 步，你的 bucket：各个组件读写这些前缀\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 3, your bucket: the components read and write these prefixes,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.80,0:06:20.90,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,每个输出都落在你们组名的下面\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and every output lands under your group's name.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.13,0:06:26.05,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,还有一个小缺口：README 没说怎么创建 bucket\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Another small gap: the README never says how to create the bucket,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.05,0:06:29.03,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,而且它的示例上传文件叫 test.mp3\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and its sample upload is named test.mp3.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.35,0:06:31.27,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在控制台里把 bucket 创建好\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Create the bucket in the console.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.52,0:06:36.96,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后把一段短录音上传到一个叫 input audios 的目录里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Then upload a short recording into a folder named input_audios,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.96,0:06:38.94,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,文件名以 input- 开头、以 .mp3 结尾\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}as input-something.mp3.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.26,0:06:41.09,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,转写文本沿用这个名字\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The transcript keeps that name,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.09,0:06:43.93,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,而且上传时只会发送名字以 input 开头的文件\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and upload only sends names starting with input.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.25,0:06:46.92,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,bucket 的名字是全局唯一的：挑一个别人没用过的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Bucket names are global: pick a unique one.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.24,0:06:49.00,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，创建你自己的 bucket\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause and create yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.10,0:06:55.71,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,你的 bucket 只放行能证明自己是谁、而且有权限的调用方\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Your bucket only lets in callers who prove who they are and have permission.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.03,0:07:00.38,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,对代码来说，这个身份就是一个服务账号，配一个 JSON 密钥\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}For code, that identity is a service account, with one JSON key.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.75,0:07:04.74,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Google 的库会把这个密钥换成一个短期有效的访问令牌\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Google's libraries turn that key into a short-lived token,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.74,0:07:08.79,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,每个打到 Google API 门口的调用，都必须通过三道关卡\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and every call to Google's API doors must pass three gates.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.03,0:07:14.17,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 1 关问你是谁：没有密钥，调用在你的 container 里就失败了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Gate 1 asks who you are: without the key, the call fails inside your container.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.49,0:07:18.01,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 2 关问你能做什么：这个账号需要角色\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Gate 2 asks what you may do: the account needs a role.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.33,0:07:21.26,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 3 关问这个 API 打开了没有\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Gate 3 asks if the API is switched on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.50,0:07:26.32,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在控制台里创建一个服务账号，比如叫 mega-pipeline-sa\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}In the console, create a service account, for example mega-pipeline-sa.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.64,0:07:30.93,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,给它授予四个角色：所有组件都要的 Storage Admin\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Grant it four roles: Storage Admin for every component,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.93,0:07:33.34,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Gemini 要的 Agent Platform User\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Agent Platform User for Gemini,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.34,0:07:37.39,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,还有 Cloud Speech Client 和 Cloud Translation API User\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Cloud Speech Client, and Cloud Translation API User.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.63,0:07:40.72,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Text-to-Speech 不需要角色。一个小疏漏\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Text-to-Speech needs no role. A small slip:
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.72,0:07:44.36,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,generate text 的 README 还写着 Vertex AI User\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the generate text README still says Vertex AI User,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.36,0:07:46.08,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,现在已经搜不到这个角色了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}which finds nothing now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.32,0:07:50.65,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,下载一个 JSON 密钥；它的文件名是一长串自动生成的字符\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Download a JSON key; it arrives with a long generated name.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.97,0:07:53.18,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,把它重命名为 mega-pipeline.json\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Rename it mega-pipeline.json,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.18,0:07:56.09,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,放进 repo 旁边的 secrets 目录\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}in the secrets folder beside the repo.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.41,0:07:58.95,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,谁拿到它，谁就能花你项目的钱\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Whoever holds it can spend your project's money:
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.95,0:08:00.82,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,绝不要 commit，也不要贴到任何地方\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}never commit or paste it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.07,0:08:05.36,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,接下来启用 API，在控制台里或者用 gcloud 都行\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Next, enable the APIs, in the console or with gcloud.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.68,0:08:09.39,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,照原样输入的话，设置项目的那条命令会失败\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Typed exactly as written, the set project command fails:
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.39,0:08:13.70,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,shell 把占位符两边的尖括号当成了重定向\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the shell reads the placeholder's angle brackets as redirections.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.02,0:08:16.90,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,输入你自己的项目 ID，不要带尖括号\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Type your own project ID, without brackets.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.13,0:08:19.92,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,接着用 gcloud services enable 这条命令\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Then the gcloud services enable command
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.92,0:08:21.52,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,把五个 API 全部打开\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}switches on all five.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.74,0:08:26.68,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,我们的笔记本没有 Google 账号，所以 gcloud 提示没有活动账号\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Our laptop had no Google account, so gcloud says no active account:
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.68,0:08:29.49,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这就是 Tutorial 0 里的登录那一步\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}that's the login step from Tutorial 0.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.81,0:08:33.28,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,登录之后，它就会启用这些 API，调用也开始记在你项目的账上\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Logged in, it enables them, and calls bill your project.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.52,0:08:38.03,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,来想一想。密钥放好了，每个 API 也都启用了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Ponder this. Your key is in place and every API is enabled,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.03,0:08:41.11,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,但你忘了 Agent Platform User 这个角色\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}but you forgot the Agent Platform User role.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.43,0:08:43.24,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,那 generate text 会在哪里失败\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Where does generate text fail:
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.24,0:08:45.62,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在你的 container 里，还是在 Google 那边？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}inside your container, or at Google?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.42,0:08:56.49,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在 Google 那边，报的是权限错误\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}At Google, as a permission error.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.81,0:09:00.30,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,密钥证明了你是谁；角色决定你能做什么\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The key proved who you are; the role decides what you may do.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.62,0:09:03.93,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,新的角色和 API 可能要几分钟才生效\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}New roles and APIs can take minutes to apply.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.25,0:09:07.20,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，把账号、密钥和 API 都设置好\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause, and set up your account, key and APIs.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.33,0:09:14.09,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,每个组件都用自己的 docker-shell.sh 来运行；我们把它读一遍\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Every component runs through its docker-shell.sh; let's read it once.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.41,0:09:17.53,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 7 行给 image 命名，container 也用这个名字\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Line 7 names the image, and the container too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.85,0:09:22.39,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 8 和第 9 行用 pwd，也就是你当前所在的目录，拼出路径\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Lines 8 and 9 build paths from pwd, the folder you're in.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.63,0:09:24.85,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,所以要在组件目录里运行它\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}So run it from the component folder.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.17,0:09:28.87,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 10 行是密钥在 container 里的路径\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Line 10 is the key's path inside the container;
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.87,0:09:32.34,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 13 行是 Docker Hub 账号的名字，dlops\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}line 13 names the Docker Hub account, dlops.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.58,0:09:35.51,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,脚本里的 case 语句，把你输入的第一个词变成一种模式\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The case statement turns your first word into a mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.83,0:09:37.72,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,什么都不加：先构建，再运行\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}No word: build, then run.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.04,0:09:40.20,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,用 dev 只构建，用 run 只运行\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Dev only builds, run only runs,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.20,0:09:43.74,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,用 prod 则为两种处理器构建并 push\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and prod builds for two processor types and pushes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.98,0:09:47.84,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,五个组件我们都先用默认模式，之后再回来讲另外三个模式\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}We'll use the default for all five, then come back to the other three.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.08,0:09:50.60,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,运行时会开两扇通往你笔记本的窗\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Running opens two windows into your laptop.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.92,0:09:53.70,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,用 -v 把组件目录放到 /app\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}-v puts the component folder at /app,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.70,0:09:57.53,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,把 repo 旁边的 secrets 目录放到 /secrets\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and the secrets folder beside the repo at /secrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.85,0:10:00.12,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,再用 -e 设置一个环境变量\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}-e sets an environment variable:
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.12,0:10:03.32,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一个路标，告诉 Google 的库密钥在哪里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}a signpost to the key for Google's libraries.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.55,0:10:08.65,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,和第 3 讲一样，venv 放在 /app 外面，所以这扇窗盖不住它\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}As in lecture 3, the venv lives outside /app, so the window can't hide it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.97,0:10:10.58,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,密钥从来不会被复制\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The key is never copied:
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.58,0:10:13.81,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,只有 container 运行的时候，/secrets 才显示它\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}/secrets shows it only while the container runs.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.05,0:10:17.12,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,现在 cd 进 transcribe audio\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Now cd into transcribe audio and run
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.12,0:10:19.60,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,运行 docker-shell.sh，不带参数\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}docker-shell.sh, no argument.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.92,0:10:22.36,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,有两步占了几乎全部时间\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Two steps take nearly all the time:
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.36,0:10:26.62,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,构建步骤 2，也就是系统软件包，还有写出 image\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}build step 2, the system packages, and writing out the image;
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.62,0:10:29.41,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第一次构建还会 pull base image\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}a first build also pulls the base image.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.73,0:10:31.07,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，自己跑一遍\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause and run it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.12,0:10:34.66,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,完整日志说明了 uv sync 为什么这么快\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The full log shows why uv sync is quick:
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.66,0:10:39.28,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,image 自带的 Python，录制时是 3.14.8\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the image's Python, 3.14.8 at the time of recording,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.28,0:10:44.07,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,已经满足 3.14 及以上，所以 uv 一个都不用下载\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}already satisfies 3.14 or newer, so uv downloads none.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.30,0:10:47.24,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,你已经在里面了，用户是 app，在 /app 里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}You're inside, as user app, in /app;
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.24,0:10:51.32,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,@ 符号后面是 container ID，每次运行都不一样\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}after the @ comes the container ID, new every run.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.64,0:10:54.13,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第一个检查是 help，和 README 里的一致\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The first check, help, matches the README.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.38,0:10:58.44,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在里面做三个额外检查：python 来自 venv\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Three extra checks inside: python comes from the venv,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.44,0:11:02.94,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,路标指向 /secrets，而这里的 /secrets 是空的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the signpost points to /secrets, and /secrets is empty here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.26,0:11:04.76,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在同一个目录里再开一个终端\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}In a second terminal,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.76,0:11:09.21,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,额外跑一个 docker inspect，就能列出这两个挂载\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}opened in the same folder, an extra docker inspect lists both mounts.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.60,0:11:12.33,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 5 步，用 chmod 加上可执行权限，没有坏处\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 5, chmod +x, is harmless:
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.33,0:11:16.15,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,额外的 ls 显示它本来就是可执行的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}an extra ls shows it's already executable.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.47,0:11:21.31,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 6 步，在 Windows 上：用 Git BASH，并在前面加上 winpty\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 6, on Windows: use Git BASH, and put winpty in front
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.31,0:11:25.13,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,如果 Docker 报错：the input device is not a TTY\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}if Docker says the input device is not a TTY.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.47,0:11:29.18,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,回到 container 里，看 Quick Reference 那一节\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Back in the container, the Quick Reference.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.23,0:11:33.34,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,下载这一步先打印它的参数，然后就停了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The download step prints its arguments, then stops:
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.34,0:11:35.27,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,报 DefaultCredentialsError\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}DefaultCredentialsError:
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.27,0:11:39.05,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,找不到 /secrets/mega-pipeline.json 这个文件\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}File /secrets/mega-pipeline.json was not found.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.30,0:11:42.14,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这就是第 1 关，在 container 里就失败了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}That's gate 1, failing inside the container.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.46,0:11:45.43,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,常见原因有：secrets 目录里没有密钥\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Usual causes: no key in the secrets folder,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.43,0:11:49.52,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,文件名不对，或者在错误的目录里运行了脚本\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}another file name, or the script run from the wrong folder.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.77,0:11:52.54,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,转写和上传也都这样停下来\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Both transcribe and upload stop the same way.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.86,0:11:55.63,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,有密钥的话，要找的是转写文本\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}With your key, look for the transcript,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.63,0:11:58.82,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后是 text prompts 下 group-01 里的一个文本文件\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}then a text file under text_prompts/group-01,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.82,0:12:00.67,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,本地和 bucket 里都有\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}locally and in the bucket.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.92,0:12:03.35,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Speech-to-Text 按音频的分钟数计费\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Speech-to-Text bills per audio minute,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.35,0:12:08.21,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,而且这个分支只保留长录音的第一段：用一段短音频\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and this branch keeps only a long recording's first chunk: use a short clip.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.53,0:12:12.03,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，自己跑一遍：下一个组件要读它的输出\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause and run it: the next component reads its output.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.27,0:12:16.38,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,接下来：输入 exit，cd 进 generate text，再运行这个脚本\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Next: exit, cd into generate text, and run the script.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.70,0:12:22.27,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它不装 ffmpeg，系统层就不一样：要从头构建，大约 50 秒\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Without ffmpeg, its system layer differs: a fresh build, about 50 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.59,0:12:24.34,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这里的 help 也和 README 一致\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Help matches the README.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.43,0:12:27.40,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,下载也一样失败了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The download fails the same way.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.72,0:12:32.23,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,生成这一步只打印参数和 generate 这个词\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The generate step prints only its arguments and the word generate,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.23,0:12:33.95,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后以退出码 0 退出\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}then exits with status 0.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.27,0:12:35.87,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它调用 Gemini 了吗？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Did it call Gemini?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.53,0:12:47.12,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,没有。下载失败了，所以循环里没有 prompt 可处理\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}No. The download had failed, so the loop had no prompts to work on.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.44,0:12:50.43,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,退出码 0 并不能证明它做了任何事\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Exit status 0 doesn't prove it did anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.67,0:12:52.39,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,上传也需要密钥\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The upload needs the key too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.71,0:12:55.46,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在 generate text 的 README 里还多一步\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The generate text README adds one step:
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.46,0:12:57.86,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,用一个变量选择 Gemini 模型\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}a variable picks the Gemini model.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.18,0:12:59.95,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Gemini 按 token 计费\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Gemini bills per token.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.18,0:13:03.54,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,接下来，synthesis audio en 的构建只要 8 秒\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Next, synthesis_audio_en builds in 8 seconds,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.54,0:13:05.32,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它的系统层用了缓存\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}its system layer cached.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.64,0:13:10.68,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,我们故意没改它的 cli.py：help 停在了 assert 那里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}We left its cli.py unedited on purpose: help stops at the assert;
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.68,0:13:12.39,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在这里，这道检查起作用了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}here, the guard works.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.63,0:13:15.75,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在笔记本上改它：透过这扇窗，改动马上就能看到\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Edit it on the laptop: the window shows it at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.07,0:13:20.99,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,现在 help 停在第 23 行，那一行在导入时就创建 Google 客户端\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Now help fails at line 23, which builds the Google client on import:
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.99,0:13:22.72,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,连 help 都需要密钥\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}even help needs the key.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.97,0:13:25.43,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,有密钥的话，你会看到 README 里的那份 help\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}With your key, you'd see the README's help.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.63,0:13:27.07,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这里没有上传这一步\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}There's no upload step:
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.07,0:13:30.43,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Text-to-Speech 直接把音频写进你的 bucket\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Text-to-Speech writes the audio straight into your bucket.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.03,0:13:33.53,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在 translate text 里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}In translate text:
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.53,0:13:38.75,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,构建用 8 秒，help 在导入时失败，然后是下载、翻译和上传\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}an 8-second build, help failing at import, then download, translate and upload.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.00,0:13:42.69,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在 synthesis audio 里也一样：先下载，再合成\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}In synthesis audio, the same: download, then synthesis.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.01,0:13:47.02,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，用你的密钥把五个都跑一遍，每跑完一个就看看 bucket\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause, and run all five with your key, checking the bucket after each.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.47,0:13:50.97,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,两个小疏漏\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Two small slips.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.02,0:13:53.07,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,翻译的目标语言是西班牙语\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The translation targeted Spanish,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.07,0:13:56.66,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,但最后的语音是法语：所以你才把它改了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}but the final voice is French: that's why you switched it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.98,0:13:59.51,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,还有那个可选的 ElevenLabs 附加任务\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}And the optional ElevenLabs bonus
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.51,0:14:03.57,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,是从 /app 里面读密钥的：把它改成指向 /secrets\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}reads its key from inside /app: point it at /secrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.42,0:14:09.38,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,输入 exit，再 cd 回 transcribe audio\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Exit, and cd back into transcribe audio.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.70,0:14:14.08,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在 How to Run 那一节，第 2 步 docker-shell.sh dev 只构建\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 2 of How to Run, docker-shell.sh dev, only builds:
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.08,0:14:15.68,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,不会启动 container\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}no container starts.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.00,0:14:17.43,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这里全都用了缓存\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Here, all was cached;
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.43,0:14:22.14,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,只要目录里有任何改动，COPY 和 uv sync 这两步就会重新跑\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}after any change in the folder, the copy and uv sync steps run again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.38,0:14:23.83,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,那 dev 是干什么用的？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}What is dev for?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.88,0:14:27.55,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,加包的时候：在 container 里跑 uv add\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Adding a package: uv add, inside the container,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.55,0:14:31.77,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它会透过这扇窗更新 pyproject.toml 和 uv.lock\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}updates pyproject.toml and uv.lock through the window;
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.77,0:14:34.35,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后用 dev 把它打包进 image\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}then dev bakes it into the image.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.20,0:14:37.25,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 3 步，run，跳过构建\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 3, run, skips the build:
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.25,0:14:39.94,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,显示 Using local image，因为本地已经有一个\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Using local image, because one exists.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.26,0:14:42.35,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，自己试试 dev 和 run\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause and try dev and run yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.58,0:14:49.45,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一个小小的不准确：README 的概述说 run 会从 registry pull\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A small inaccuracy: the README's overview says run pulls from the registry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.77,0:14:53.66,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,实际上，只要本地有同名的 image，不管多旧都会被用上\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}In fact, any local image of that name wins, however old;
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.66,0:14:58.32,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,否则它运行 Docker Hub 上的 image，只在第一次 pull\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}otherwise it runs the Docker Hub image, pulled only the first time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.57,0:15:03.49,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,来想一想。有个队友从没构建过这个 image\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Ponder this. A teammate has never built this image,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.49,0:15:05.56,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,直接输入 docker-shell.sh run\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and types docker-shell.sh run.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.88,0:15:07.48,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个队友会拿到哪个 Python？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Which Python do they get?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.22,0:15:20.68,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这条额外的命令删掉我们本地的 image，这样我们就成了那个队友\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}This extra command deletes our local image, so we become that teammate.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.82,0:15:24.44,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,提示 Local image not found\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Local image not found,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.44,0:15:27.70,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,于是它从 Docker Hub pull 了 dlops 的 image\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}so it pulls the dlops image from Docker Hub.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.02,0:15:30.48,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,接着来了个意外：显示 Creating a Pipfile\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Then, a surprise: Creating a Pipfile.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.80,0:15:33.74,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这是 pipenv，这门课在 uv 之前用的工具\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}That's pipenv, this course's tool before uv.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.98,0:15:36.58,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,提示符显示的是 root\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The prompt says root.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.63,0:15:41.26,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Python 是 3.8.17，在一个 pipenv 建的环境里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Python is 3.8.17, in an environment pipenv made.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.58,0:15:45.59,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这里 help 还能用，只是用的是 Python 3.8 的旧措辞\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Help still works here, in the older wording of Python 3.8.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.91,0:15:47.51,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后输入 exit\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Then type exit.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.00,0:15:55.25,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一个额外的 inspect 打开了这个盒子\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}An extra inspect opens the box:
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.25,0:16:00.38,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,创建于 2025 年 2 月 18 日，Python 3.8.17\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}created on February 18, 2025, with Python 3.8.17,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.38,0:16:03.63,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,启动 pipenv shell，以 root 运行\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}starting pipenv shell, as root.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.67,0:16:08.81,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它的构建对应的是一个更旧的分支，pipenv-flexible-workflow\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Its build matches an older branch, pipenv-flexible-workflow,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.81,0:16:10.18,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,而不是你的配方\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}not your recipe.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.23,0:16:14.42,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,你的目录盖在它的 /app 上：你的代码，他们的环境\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Your folder slides over its /app: your code, their environment.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.74,0:16:18.30,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,对 generate text 来说，这就是开头那个导入错误\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}For generate text, that's the import error from the start:
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.30,0:16:19.90,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第一个谜题，解开了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the first puzzle, solved.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.18,0:16:26.60,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它还在你的目录里留下了一个 Pipfile，属于 root\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}It also left a Pipfile in your folder, owned by root.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.92,0:16:28.47,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,如果你试过这一步，就把它删掉\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}If you tried this,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.47,0:16:30.91,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,再跑一次 dev，把你自己的 image 找回来\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}delete it and run dev to get your own image back.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.35,0:16:35.15,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,所以要在本地构建，不带参数或者用 dev\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}So build locally, with no argument or dev,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.15,0:16:39.30,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,run 只用于你们组从这个分支 push 上去的 image\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and use run only for images your team pushed from this branch,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.30,0:16:41.57,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,而且是在你们自己的 Docker Hub 账号下\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}under your own Docker Hub account.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.00,0:16:46.94,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 4 步，prod，负责发布\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 4, prod, publishes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.26,0:16:49.91,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它会重新创建一个叫 multi-arch 的构建器\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}It recreates a builder named multi-arch,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.91,0:16:52.76,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一个能为多种处理器构建的构建引擎\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}a build engine for several processor types.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.08,0:16:57.21,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,加了 --use，它就成了当前的构建器，而脚本从不切回去\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}--use makes it current, and the script never switches back:
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.21,0:16:59.38,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,切回来要用 docker buildx use default\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}docker buildx use default does.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.62,0:17:04.08,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后一条 buildx build 做出 amd64 和 arm64 两个 image\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Then one buildx build makes amd64 and arm64 images
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.08,0:17:06.75,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,用同一个 tag 一起 push 上去\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and pushes both under one tag:
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.75,0:17:11.03,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,和第 2 讲一样，Apple Silicon 的 Mac 会 pull 其中一个\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}as in lecture 2, an Apple-silicon Mac pulls one,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.03,0:17:12.91,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,云上的 VM 会 pull 另一个\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}a cloud VM the other.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.15,0:17:16.04,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,跑 prod 之前，先用访问令牌登录\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Before prod, log in with an access token;
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.04,0:17:18.50,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,用 -p 的话，它会留在你的 shell 历史记录里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}-p leaves it in your shell history.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.82,0:17:21.47,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,把脚本里的 Docker Hub 用户名改成你自己的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Set the Docker username in the script to your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.79,0:17:25.12,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂时别跑 prod：先检查一下它会发布什么\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Don't run prod yet: first, check what it would publish.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.37,0:17:28.70,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,原因是这样的。在切换了分支的第 3 讲 clone 里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Here's why. In the switched lecture 3 clone,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.70,0:17:31.43,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,旧密钥还留在 transcribe audio 里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the old key still sits in transcribe audio.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.75,0:17:36.51,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在那里用 dev 构建，再用一条额外的命令列出新 image 的 /app\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Build there with dev, and an extra command lists the new image's /app:
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.51,0:17:37.93,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,密钥就在里面\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the key is inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.98,0:17:40.20,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,而 COPY 那一行会把整个目录都装进去\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The copy line takes the whole folder.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.52,0:17:43.02,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,那个 .gitignore 让 secrets 进不了 Git\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The .gitignore keeps secrets out of Git,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.02,0:17:44.21,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,却挡不住它进 image\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}not out of images,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.21,0:17:46.35,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,而且哪个分支都没有 .dockerignore\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and no branch has a .dockerignore.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.67,0:17:49.18,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,跑 prod 就会把你的密钥 push 到 Docker Hub\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Prod would push your key to Docker Hub.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.23,0:17:52.72,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,所以 README 的承诺对 Git 成立，对 image 不成立\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}So the README's promise holds for Git, not for images.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.04,0:17:56.02,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,删掉组件里面的每个 secrets 目录\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Delete any secrets folder inside a component,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.02,0:17:58.40,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,加一个列出 secrets 的 .dockerignore\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}add a .dockerignore listing secrets,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.40,0:18:01.45,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,如果哪个密钥曾经被 push 出去，就把那个密钥删掉\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and if a key was ever pushed, delete that key.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.77,0:18:06.55,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,至于 prod，它是可选的：修好之后，只有你们组要发布时才运行它\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Prod is optional: after the fix, run it only if your team publishes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.87,0:18:08.47,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，检查你自己的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause and check yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.08,0:18:11.68,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第一部分的清理\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Clean-up for part 1.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.90,0:18:15.37,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,退出每个 container；--rm 会把它删掉\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Exit each container; --rm deletes it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.69,0:18:19.53,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,光 transcribe 的 image 就有 1.48 GB\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The transcribe image alone is 1.48 gigabytes:
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.53,0:18:22.68,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,用 docker image rm 把五个都删掉\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}remove all five with docker image rm,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.68,0:18:25.49,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,再加上你 pull 过的 dlops 的 image\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}plus any dlops images you pulled.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.73,0:18:29.33,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在云上，bucket 会一直收一点存储费\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}In the cloud, the bucket bills a little storage until you delete it,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.33,0:18:31.22,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,直到你删掉它，也就是课程结束的时候\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}when the course is over;
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.22,0:18:34.14,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,密钥在你去控制台删掉之前一直有效\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the key works until you delete it in the console.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.46,0:18:37.98,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第二部分：互相直接通信的 container\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}In part 2: containers that talk to each other directly.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.12,0:18:43.47,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在第一部分，container 只是把文件留在 bucket 里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}In part 1, containers only left files in a bucket.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.79,0:18:46.71,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个 port toy 让两个 container 直接通信\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Port toy makes two containers talk directly,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.71,0:18:50.02,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,而且只需要 Docker：一个 gateway 提供网页\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and needs only Docker: a gateway serves a web page
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.02,0:18:54.54,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,把你的文字转发给一个 processor，processor 再把它变成大写\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and forwards your text to a processor, which turns it into capitals.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.78,0:18:57.94,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,把每个 container 想成一台独立的小电脑\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Think of each container as its own little computer,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.94,0:19:01.23,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,有自己的 localhost，也有自己的一整套 port\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}with its own localhost and its own full set of ports.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.55,0:19:05.86,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,两个 container 都可以用 port 9100，完全不会冲突\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Two containers can both use port 9100 without any clash.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.18,0:19:09.12,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这节课把这叫作网络命名空间\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The lecture calls this a network namespace:
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.12,0:19:12.19,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,每个 container 都是隔离的，直到你把它们连起来\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}each container is isolated until you wire it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.43,0:19:16.05,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,你自己创建的网络把它们连起来，就像家里的小局域网\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A network you create joins them like a small home network,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.05,0:19:19.79,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,还带一本电话簿，把 container 名变成地址\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}with a phone book that turns container names into addresses.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.11,0:19:22.23,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Docker 的默认网络没有电话簿\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Docker's default network has none.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.47,0:19:23.63,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,先看 Prerequisites\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Prerequisites:
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.63,0:19:26.82,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,用 docker run hello-world 检查 Docker 有没有在运行\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}docker run hello-world checks that Docker is running.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.14,0:19:30.42,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它会 pull 一个很小的 image，打印出 Hello from Docker\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}It pulls a tiny image and prints Hello from Docker!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.67,0:19:32.91,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 1 步手动把应用搭起来\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 1 sets the app up by hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.23,0:19:35.95,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在你的工作区目录里，把代码 clone 下来\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}From your workspace folder, clone the code:
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.95,0:19:39.50,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,README 说 clone 或下载，却没给命令\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the README says clone or download but prints no command.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.82,0:19:41.55,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后 cd 进 port toy 目录\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Then cd into port toy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.87,0:19:43.32,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，把它们跑一遍\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause and run them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.37,0:19:46.83,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,两个额外检查：文件和 README 里的目录树一致\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Two extra checks: the files match the README's tree,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.83,0:19:48.56,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一个 gateway，一个 processor\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}a gateway and a processor,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.56,0:19:51.56,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,git log 显示这个视频 pin 住的 commit\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and git log shows the commit this video pins.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.80,0:19:54.21,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,接下来：docker network create toynet\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Next, docker network create toynet.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.53,0:19:56.71,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Docker 打印出新网络的 ID\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Docker prints the new network's ID:
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.71,0:19:59.63,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这就是两个 container 都要接上去的那根导轨\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}that's the rail both containers will plug into.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.87,0:20:02.04,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,从 README 的 Handy commands 里拿一条\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}From the README's handy commands,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.04,0:20:03.81,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,docker network ls 把它列出来\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}docker network ls lists it,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.81,0:20:06.44,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,旁边是 Docker 的三个内置网络\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}beside Docker's three built-in networks.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.76,0:20:08.36,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，创建你自己的网络\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause, and create yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.38,0:20:11.09,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,接下来，构建两个 image\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Next, build two images.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.41,0:20:14.86,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,两个 Dockerfile 几乎一模一样\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The two Dockerfiles are almost identical:
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.86,0:20:18.64,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一个精简版的 Python 3.14 image，再从 apt 装上 curl\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}a slim Python 3.14 image, plus curl from apt.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.96,0:20:21.68,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,每个都把自己的代码复制进去，用 -u 运行\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Each copies its code and runs it with -u,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.68,0:20:23.87,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这样打印的内容会马上进到日志里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}so prints reach the logs at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.12,0:20:27.91,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,先构建的是 processor，它的 apt 那一层要花几秒钟\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The processor builds first, and its apt layer takes a few seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.23,0:20:31.43,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,你第一次构建时，还会 pull Python 的 base image\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Your first build also pulls the Python base image.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.68,0:20:32.81,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后是 gateway\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Then the gateway:
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.81,0:20:36.42,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Docker 从缓存里复用了 processor 的 apt 那一层\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Docker reuses the processor's apt layer from the cache,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.42,0:20:39.58,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,因为两个文件在 COPY 那一行之前都一样\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}because the two files match up to the copy line.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.90,0:20:41.50,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,不到 1 秒就构建完了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}It's done in under a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.48,0:20:48.26,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后在 toynet 上启动 processor，PORT 设为 9200，不加 -p\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Then start the processor on toynet, with PORT set to 9200, and no -p.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.58,0:20:54.45,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它在自己的盒子里监听 9200，但你笔记本上没有任何东西通向它\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}It listens on 9200 inside its own box, but nothing on your laptop leads to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.70,0:20:56.30,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后启动 gateway\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Then start the gateway.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.43,0:21:00.60,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这里的 -p 会发布一个 port：它在你笔记本上开一扇临街的门\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}-p publishes a port: it opens a street door on your laptop
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.60,0:21:03.62,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,通向 container 里面的一个房间\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}that leads to a room inside the container.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.94,0:21:09.42,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,顺序是 IP 地址、host port、container port\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The order is IP address, host port, container port:
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.42,0:21:13.30,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,127.0.0.1，意思是只限这台笔记本\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}127.0.0.1, meaning this laptop only,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.30,0:21:16.63,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后是 8090 号门，最后是 9100 号房间\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}then door 8090, then room 9100.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.12,0:21:21.90,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,两个 -e 参数告诉 gateway 该去调用哪里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The two -e flags tell the gateway where to call:
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.90,0:21:24.26,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,名字是 processor，port 是 9200\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the name processor, port 9200.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.58,0:21:27.27,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它代码里的第 13 和第 14 行读取这两个值\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Lines 13 and 14 of its code read them;
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.27,0:21:30.45,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,那里引号里的值只是默认值\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the values in quotes there are only defaults.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.68,0:21:32.67,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,现在对两个分别跑一下 docker logs\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Now check docker logs for each.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.99,0:21:39.75,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,日志里，processor 监听 9200，只在内部；gateway 监听 9100\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The processor listens on 9200, internal only; the gateway listens on 9100.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.07,0:21:41.67,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，把两个都启动\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause and start both.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.73,0:21:47.61,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 1 步的最后，在浏览器里打开 localhost:8090\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}To finish step 1, open localhost:8090 in your browser,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.61,0:21:49.83,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,输入一条消息，点 Send\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}type a message, and click Send.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.15,0:21:55.44,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,回复是大写的，还带着三个 port 数字：gateway 从哪里发出\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The reply comes back in capitals, with three port numbers: where the gateway sent from,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.44,0:21:59.75,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,processor 在哪里监听，以及它看到消息是从哪里来的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}where the processor listened, and where it saw the message arrive from.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.00,0:22:05.14,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,我们录制时没有浏览器，所以用 curl 发了和网页一模一样的请求\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}We recorded without a browser, so curl sent the same request the page sends;
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.14,0:22:06.83,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这是它拿到的回复\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}this is the reply it got.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.55,0:22:11.35,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个 processor 监听的是 9200，也就是目的地\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The processor listened on 9200, the destination.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.67,0:22:16.00,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,但每个连接都有两端，所以 gateway 这一端也需要一个 port\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}But every connection has two ends, so the gateway's side needs a port too.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.32,0:22:23.57,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它的操作系统挑了一个临时的，55620，把它钉在数据包上\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Its operating system picked a temporary one, 55620, and stapled it to the packet.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.82,0:22:26.22,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在 processor 那边，看到的是同一个数字\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The processor saw the same number arrive,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.22,0:22:28.98,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,因为在网络内部没有任何东西会改写它\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}because nothing rewrites it inside the network.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.30,0:22:32.60,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,代码里，gateway 的第 38 行读取自己的 port\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Line 38 of the gateway reads its own port;
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.60,0:22:36.06,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,processor 的第 32 行读取发送方的 port\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}line 32 of the processor reads the sender's.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.30,0:22:41.23,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,再发一次，这个数字就变了：新的连接，新的临时 port\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Send again, and the number changes: a new connection, a new temporary port.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.55,0:22:43.00,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,你的会不一样\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Yours will differ.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.05,0:22:46.58,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,还有一个细节：页面上的示意图显示 8090\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}One more detail: the page's diagram shows 8090
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.58,0:22:48.96,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,靠的是读取它自己的地址栏\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}by reading its own address bar.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.28,0:22:52.63,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个 container 没法知道，你在笔记本上给它开的是哪扇门\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The container can't know which door on your laptop you gave it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.95,0:22:55.70,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，发一条消息，两个都别停\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause, send a message, and leave both running.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.75,0:22:58.44,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 2 步检查 port\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 2 checks the ports.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.76,0:23:05.51,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,用 docker ps 能看到 gateway 的映射，host 那一侧在前\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}docker ps shows the gateway's mapping, host side first:
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.51,0:23:09.19,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,127.0.0.1，port 8090，到 9100\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}127.0.0.1, port 8090, to 9100.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.51,0:23:14.05,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,而 processor 的 PORTS 那一列是空的：在监听，但没有发布\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The processor's PORTS column is empty: listening, but not published.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.30,0:23:18.67,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,额外跑一个只有三列的 docker ps，和 README 里的示例一致\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}An extra docker ps with three columns matches the README's sample.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.07,0:23:23.82,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,那个 127.0.0.1 有什么用？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}What does the 127.0.0.1 do?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.14,0:23:28.75,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这次额外的运行把它去掉了，要在所有地址上开 8090 号门\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}This extra run leaves it out, asking for door 8090 on every address.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.07,0:23:32.25,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Docker 拒绝了，报 port is already allocated\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Docker refuses, port is already allocated:
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.25,0:23:34.00,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,我们的 gateway 占着 8090\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}our gateway holds 8090.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.32,0:23:37.16,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,不过 container 还是创建出来了，所以要把它删掉\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The container was still created, so remove it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.40,0:23:42.14,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,用 8091 号门就成功了，映射显示 0.0.0.0\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}With door 8091 it works, and the mapping shows 0.0.0.0:
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.14,0:23:47.58,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,所有地址，所以你所在网络里的其他机器也能连进来\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}every address, so other machines on your network could connect.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.90,0:23:55.43,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,把它删掉。所以 README 写的是 127.0.0.1：只限这台笔记本\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Remove it. That's why the README writes 127.0.0.1: this laptop only.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.67,0:23:59.78,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在笔记本上，用 curl 访问 8090，返回的是 gateway 的页面\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}From the laptop, curl on 8090 returns the gateway's page.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.10,0:24:02.38,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,用 curl 访问 9200 就连不上\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}curl on 9200 can't connect:
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.38,0:24:08.45,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,你的笔记本上没有通向它的门，除非你自己有别的程序在用 9200\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}your laptop has no door to it, unless something else of yours uses 9200.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.68,0:24:12.28,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,用 docker exec 在 gateway 里面运行 curl\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}From inside the gateway, docker exec runs curl,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.28,0:24:15.64,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,按名字 processor 去问 port 9200\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}asking for the name processor, on port 9200.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.96,0:24:17.56,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,回答是：ok\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The answer: ok.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.72,0:24:22.33,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,来想一想。同一条命令，把 processor 换成 localhost\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Ponder this. The same command with localhost instead of processor.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.65,0:24:24.25,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,谁会回答？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}What answers?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.52,0:24:35.67,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,什么都没有。在 gateway 里面，localhost 就是 gateway 自己\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Nothing. Inside the gateway, localhost is the gateway itself,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.67,0:24:38.30,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,而它那里没有任何东西在 9200 上监听\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and nothing there listens on 9200.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.62,0:24:40.25,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这就是第二个谜题的答案\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}That's the second puzzle:
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.25,0:24:42.66,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,每个 container 都有自己的 localhost\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}each container has its own localhost.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.98,0:24:46.22,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一个额外检查：换成 9100，也就是它自己的 port\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}An extra check: on 9100, its own port,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.22,0:24:48.52,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,localhost 就返回页面\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}localhost returns the page.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.77,0:24:50.37,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,那名字又是怎么起作用的？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}So how did the name work?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.64,0:24:52.18,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,从 Handy commands 里拿一条\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}From the handy commands,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.18,0:24:55.89,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,docker network inspect 显示每个 container 的地址\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}docker network inspect shows an address for each container,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.89,0:24:58.67,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,都来自 toynet 自己的地址范围，也就是它的子网\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}from toynet's own address range, its subnet.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.77,0:25:04.22,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,每个 container 都去问 Docker 内置的电话簿\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Each container asks Docker's built-in phone book,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.22,0:25:09.13,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它在 127.0.0.11，把名字变成这些地址\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}at 127.0.0.11, which turns names into those addresses.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.45,0:25:13.14,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一个 container 重启时，地址可能会变；名字不会变\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Addresses can change when a container restarts; names stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.38,0:25:15.26,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,再来一条 Handy commands 里的命令\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Another handy command,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.26,0:25:19.43,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,docker exec -it gateway sh，在里面打开一个 shell\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}docker exec -it gateway sh, opens a shell inside;
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.43,0:25:22.24,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它的主机名就是 container ID\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}its hostname is the container ID.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.56,0:25:25.40,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,补充一句：processor 的 image 里其实也有 curl\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}One aside: the processor image has curl too,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.40,0:25:27.78,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,虽然 README 暗示它没有\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}though the README implies it doesn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.10,0:25:30.15,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，从两边都试一试\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause, and test from both sides.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.80,0:25:33.72,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 3 步修改 port\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 3 changes the ports.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.04,0:25:36.35,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,先改临街的门\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}First the street door:
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.35,0:25:42.96,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,删掉 gateway，再在 127.0.0.1 的 port 8095 上重新启动它\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}remove the gateway, and start it again on 127.0.0.1, port 8095.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.28,0:25:45.88,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,里面的房间还是 9100\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The room inside stays 9100.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.12,0:25:48.40,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,页面在 8095 上能用\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The page works on 8095.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.72,0:25:51.75,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,两个额外检查：8090 已经连不上了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Two extra checks: 8090 no longer connects,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.75,0:25:54.35,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,docker ps 也显示出新的映射\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and docker ps shows the new mapping.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.67,0:25:56.89,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，把你的 gateway 的门也挪过去\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause and move your gateway's door.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.17,0:26:00.44,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,为什么要这么做？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Why do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.49,0:26:04.07,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,你笔记本上可能已经有别的应用占着 8090\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Another app on your laptop might already hold 8090.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.39,0:26:09.43,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,笔记本上的门必须各不相同；container 里的房间永远不会撞车\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Doors on the laptop must be unique; rooms inside containers never collide.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.67,0:26:14.51,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一个小疏漏：gateway 的日志里还是说打开 localhost:8090\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A small slip: the gateway's log still says open localhost:8090.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.83,0:26:17.41,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,那段文字是写死在第 53 行的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}That text is hard-coded in line 53.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.73,0:26:20.33,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,要以 docker ps 和页面为准\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Trust docker ps and the page instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.58,0:26:22.67,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,接下来是 processor 的 port\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Next, the processor's port:
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.67,0:26:26.22,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,删掉它，再把 PORT 设为 9300 启动它\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}remove it, and start it with PORT set to 9300.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.54,0:26:29.67,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,README 里说：发一条消息，应该会失败\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The README says: send a message, and it should fail.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.07,0:26:31.67,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,确实失败了，只是悄无声息\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}It does, but quietly.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.88,0:26:35.77,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,页面没有错误处理，所以上面什么都不会变\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The page has no error handling, so nothing on it changes;
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.77,0:26:38.71,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,我们录下的那次请求只拿到 curl 的报错\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the captured request got only curl's error,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.71,0:26:40.35,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Empty reply from server\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Empty reply from server.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.58,0:26:44.10,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,额外在 gateway 上跑一下 docker logs\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}An extra docker logs on the gateway shows why:
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.10,0:26:46.47,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,就知道原因：它通过名字找到了 processor\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}it found the processor by name,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.47,0:26:51.29,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,但连接被拒绝了，已经没有人在 9200 上监听\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}but the connection was refused: nobody listens on 9200 anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.61,0:26:56.25,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,名字写错的话，失败的方式不一样：见练习。来想一想\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A wrong name fails differently: see the exercises. Ponder this.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.57,0:27:00.39,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,改哪一个设置能修好它，又有没有哪个 image 需要重新构建？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Which one setting fixes it, and does any image need rebuilding?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.23,0:27:09.32,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,改 gateway 的 processor port 变量\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The gateway's processor port.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.37,0:27:12.51,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,删掉 gateway，用 9300 重新启动它\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Remove the gateway and start it with 9300,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.51,0:27:15.72,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,门也换回 8090，消息就能发过去了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}back on 8090, and the message goes through.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.04,0:27:19.48,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,没有重新构建任何 image：这只是配置\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}No image was rebuilt: it's only configuration.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.80,0:27:21.40,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，把你的也修好\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause and fix yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.23,0:27:25.27,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,两个设置必须一致：processor 的 PORT\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The two settings must agree: the processor's PORT
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.27,0:27:27.31,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,和 gateway 的 processor port\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and the gateway's processor port.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.55,0:27:32.29,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,最后，用 Compose 之前先清理：删掉两个 container，再删网络\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Finally, clean up before Compose: remove both containers, then the network.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.61,0:27:36.36,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一个额外检查显示，只剩下 hello-world 那个旧 container\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}An extra check shows only hello-world's old container left.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.68,0:27:39.52,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,跳过这一步，Compose 就会遇到名字冲突\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Skip this, and Compose hits a name conflict.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.84,0:27:41.44,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，清理干净\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause and clean up.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.43,0:27:47.70,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 4 步：Docker Compose，它根据一个配置文件\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 4: Docker Compose, which builds and starts the whole app from one YAML file.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.70,0:27:49.66,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,把整个应用构建好并启动起来\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 4: Docker Compose, which builds and starts the whole app from one YAML file.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.98,0:27:54.46,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,README 里只给了节选；把完整的 docker-compose.yml 打开\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The README shows an excerpt; open the whole docker-compose.yml.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.78,0:27:58.15,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,你手动敲过的参数，几乎每一个都能在里面找到位置\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Almost every flag you typed by hand has a home in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.40,0:28:02.99,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,原来的 --name 变成了 container name，构建命令变成了 build\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}--name becomes container name, and the build command becomes build.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.31,0:28:04.81,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,原来的 -p 变成了 ports\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}-p becomes ports,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.81,0:28:10.11,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,-e 变成了 environment，而网络在文件最下面命名\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}-e becomes environment, and the network is named at the bottom of the file.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.00,0:28:13.15,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,有两个键是新的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Two keys are new:
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.15,0:28:16.79,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,volumes 这个键把 gateway 的目录挂载到 /app\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the volumes key mounts the gateway's folder into /app,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.79,0:28:20.17,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,depends on 这个键让 processor 先启动\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and the depends on key starts the processor first.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.49,0:28:24.57,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,整个第 1 步合成了一条命令：docker compose up\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}All of step 1 collapses into one command: docker compose up.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.80,0:28:29.24,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,运行它。Compose 构建了两个 image，全部用了缓存\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Run it. Compose builds both images, all from the cache,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.24,0:28:33.87,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,并按目录名和服务名给它们命名：port toy 加上 -gateway\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and names them after the folder and the service: port_toy-gateway.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.12,0:28:37.04,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后它创建网络和两个 container\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Then it creates the network and both containers,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.04,0:28:40.75,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,打印出两个横幅，每一行前面都标着它的服务名\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and prints both banners, each line prefixed with its service.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.07,0:28:42.42,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，自己跑一遍\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause and run it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.47,0:28:44.28,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,打开页面：能用\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Open the page: it works.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.60,0:28:47.72,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在第二个终端里，先 cd 进 port toy\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}In a second terminal, cd into port toy first:
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.72,0:28:50.85,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Compose 读的是当前目录里的文件\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Compose reads the file in the current folder.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.17,0:28:54.31,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在那里，docker compose ps 显示同样的映射\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}There, docker compose ps shows the same mapping.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.55,0:28:58.48,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,额外的 network ls 显示，toynet 是 Compose 创建的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}An extra network ls shows that Compose made toynet,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.48,0:29:02.40,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,而 compose exec 按名字连到了 processor，回复 ok\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and compose exec reaches the processor by name: ok.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.77,0:29:05.03,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,README 的那张表把每条手动敲的命令\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The README's table pairs each by-hand command with its Compose version.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.03,0:29:07.31,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,和它在 Compose 里的写法一一对应\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The README's table pairs each by-hand command with its Compose version.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.63,0:29:10.94,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在第一个终端里，你的请求现在会出现在日志里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}In the first terminal, your requests now show in the log.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.18,0:29:14.30,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,README 到第 4 步最后才停掉应用\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The README stops the app at the end of step 4;
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.30,0:29:17.56,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,我们现在就在前台停掉它：按 Ctrl-C\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}we stop it now, in the foreground: press Ctrl+C.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.88,0:29:22.04,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Compose 说它正在优雅地停止，但要花大约 20 秒\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Compose says it's stopping gracefully, but it takes about 20 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.25,0:29:27.86,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,作为每个 container 的第一个进程\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Python, each container's first process,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.86,0:29:29.87,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Python 会忽略这个礼貌的停止信号\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}ignores the polite stop signal
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.87,0:29:32.01,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,除非程序里专门写了捕获它的代码\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}unless it's written to catch it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.33,0:29:35.87,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,所以 Docker 对每个 container 等 10 秒，然后强行杀掉它\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}So Docker waits 10 seconds per container, then kills it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.78,0:29:41.58,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,退出码 137 表示被强行杀掉\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Exit code 137 means killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.90,0:29:43.58,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,用 docker compose ps -a 一看\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}docker compose ps -a:
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.58,0:29:47.00,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,两个 container 都退出了，但还在那里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}both containers exited, but they're still there.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.23,0:29:50.27,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,输入 docker compose down\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}docker compose down removes the containers
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.27,0:29:53.59,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它删掉 container 和网络，ps -a 里什么都不剩\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and the network, and nothing is left in ps -a.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.91,0:29:56.24,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,按 Ctrl-C 是停止；down 才是删除\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Ctrl+C stops; down removes.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.56,0:29:58.50,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，把整个流程跑一遍\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause, and run the whole cycle.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.53,0:30:05.31,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,回到 README 的顺序：up -d 在后台启动应用，把提示符还给你\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Back to the README's order: up -d starts the app in the background and returns your prompt.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.55,0:30:07.31,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,两条 Handy commands 里的命令\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Two handy commands.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.36,0:30:10.87,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,用 compose logs -f 持续跟踪 gateway 的日志\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}docker compose logs -f follows the gateway's log;
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.87,0:30:13.17,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,按 Ctrl-C 只停止跟踪\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Ctrl+C stops only the following.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.49,0:30:16.89,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,用 compose exec gateway sh 打开一个 shell\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}docker compose exec gateway sh opens a shell,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.89,0:30:20.44,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在里面，环境变量显示的是 processor 和 9200\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}where the environment shows processor and 9200.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.08,0:30:25.86,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,接下来，README 里说：在文件里重做一遍 port 实验\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Next, the README says to repeat the port experiments in the file.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.18,0:30:29.48,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,把 8090 改成 8095，再运行 up -d\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Change 8090 to 8095 and run up -d:
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.48,0:30:32.88,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Compose 只重新创建 gateway\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Compose recreates only the gateway.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.12,0:30:37.45,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,页面在 8095 上有回应；把它改回去，再让它生效一次\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The page answers on 8095; change it back and apply again.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.30,0:30:42.65,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,我们在 processor 的代码里加了一行注释\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}We added a comment to the processor's code.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.97,0:30:46.91,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,复制进 image 的代码改了，就要加 --build\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Changed code that's copied into an image needs --build.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.23,0:30:51.48,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,只有 COPY 那一层是新的，也只有 processor 被重新创建\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Only the copy layer is new, and only the processor is recreated.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.72,0:30:53.78,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,那个 gateway 的目录是挂载进去的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The gateway's folder is mounted,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.78,0:30:56.16,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,而且它每次加载都会重新读页面\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and it rereads its page on each load:
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.16,0:30:59.31,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,改动在下次刷新时就能看到，不用重新构建\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}edits show on the next reload, without a rebuild.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.17,0:31:04.73,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,最后，docker compose down；ps -a 里什么都不剩\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}To finish, docker compose down; nothing is left in ps -a.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.05,0:31:10.51,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这些 image 还在，共用大约 200 MB；删掉它们可以腾出空间\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The images remain, sharing about 200 megabytes; remove them to free space.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.83,0:31:12.44,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个 port toy 一分钱都不花\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Port toy costs nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.65,0:31:14.25,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，把它关掉\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause and shut it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.33,0:31:17.11,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,自测一下，每道题之后都暂停一下\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}To test yourself, pause after each question.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.43,0:31:20.44,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第一题：哪些文件定义了一个 mega-pipeline 的 image\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}One: which files define a mega-pipeline image,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.44,0:31:23.72,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,本地没有 image 时，run 用的又是什么？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and what does run use when there's no local image?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.97,0:31:25.94,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第二题：调用你的 bucket 时\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Two: which three gates must a call
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.94,0:31:28.85,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,必须通过哪三道关卡，每一道又在哪里失败？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}to your bucket pass, and where does each one fail?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.17,0:31:31.14,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第三题：一个被 Git 忽略的密钥\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Three: how does a git-ignored key
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.14,0:31:33.46,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,怎么会跑进 image 里，又该怎么修？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}end up in an image, and what's the fix?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.70,0:31:40.66,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第四题：-p 127.0.0.1:8095:9100\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Four: -p 127.0.0.1:8095:9100.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.98,0:31:46.59,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,浏览器用哪个数字，gateway 绑定哪个\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Which number does the browser use, which does the gateway bind,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.59,0:31:49.53,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,127.0.0.1 又限制了什么？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and what does 127.0.0.1 restrict?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.85,0:31:52.65,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第五题：在 gateway 里面，localhost 是什么\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Five: inside the gateway, what is localhost,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.65,0:31:55.01,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,哪个名字能连到 processor？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and which name reaches the processor?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.25,0:31:58.97,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,下节课，一个命令行 container 会在 Compose 网络上\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Next lecture, a command-line container calls a database
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.97,0:32:01.61,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,按名字调用一个数据库 container\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}container by name on a Compose network,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.61,0:32:05.13,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,用的还是同样的 secrets 挂载：第一部分和第二部分合在一起\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}with the same secrets mount: parts 1 and 2 together.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.45,0:32:07.50,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,答案在练习里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Answers are in the exercises.
